silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_06_visible_atoms_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '06VisibleatomsYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In the Music graph engine entry section 06_visible_atoms, the ]\\\\ (-,MusicPage) [rr, arrow witnesses the Mittens microchip-id arrow witnessing identifier-by-leg, distinct from identifier-as-Mittens.; also, In the Music graph engine entry section 06_visible_atoms, the music_typed_leg_5 arrow witnesses the DomesticCat classification arrow as a typed source leg into D_Mittens — NOT an identity onto Mittens." .
